butes/conversation",".insrc/artifacts/HLD-206db3426ffd4428.json#/body/erDefinition/classes/Task/attributes/attempts","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/HLD.md:56","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/er-model.html: embedded Mermaid relationship declarations"]}],"inspectedReferences":["/body/sharedContracts","/body/sharedContracts/0","/body/sharedContracts/1","/body/sharedContracts/2","/body/nonFunctional","/body/erDefinition","/body/sequenceDefinition","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/0","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/1","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/2","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/3","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/4","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/5","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/6","/citations/12","/citations/18","document:line:293","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/HLD.md",".insrc/artifacts/HLD-206db3426ffd4428.json",".insrc/tmp/design-review/consolidated-chat-progress-hld.json: architecture feedback and inventory","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/DEF.md","docs/standalone/show-background-task-progress-chat-E2026110407024f1d/SPEC.md: lifecycle, observation and qualification requirements","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/er-model.html: embedded Mermaid source","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/sequence-diagram.html: embedded Mermaid source","src/shared/types.ts: IpcStreamMessage and ProgressEvent contracts","src/daemon/chat-sessions.ts","src/daemon/request-context.ts","src/daemon/server.ts: trusted connection identity, dispatch and disconnect handling","src/daemon/__tests__/connection-request-context.test.ts","src/daemon/__tests__/review-runtime-owner.test.ts","vscode-plugin/src/chat/chat-panel.ts: status projection and detached terminal handling","vscode-plugin/src/chat/session-file-store.ts: capacity eviction","vscode-plugin/src/chat/__tests__/session-file-store.test.ts: persistence, stale writes and lifecycle coverage"],"limitations":["Actual renderings of docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/er-model.html and docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/sequence-diagram.html could not be inspected: the browser access host was unavailable and native Google Chrome access was denied. Their embedded sources were inspected, including all sequence participants and terminal persistence ordering; successful rendering, readability and layout remain unverified."],"advice":["During story design, make the authorization bridge explicit for reconnects and multiple windows. Existing TrustedRpcContext supplies a server-minted connection identity and daemon epoch, while client labels are untrusted; specify how a replacement connection establishes authorized access to retained project/conversation tasks.","Carry the stated qualification commitments into focused cases for terminal persistence failure, exhausted observation reservations, owner lease expiry, delayed prior-epoch callbacks and conversation removal during renewal. Existing transport and session tests provide useful seams but do not establish these future coordinator behaviors."]},{"chunkId":"producers","status":"passed","summary":"Inspected all assigned producer contracts and citations against the live HLD, DEF, upstream requirements, current implementations and relevant tests. No blocking design defect was demonstrated. The adapters preserve executor authority, distinguish supported measurements from unknown values, separate review coverage and publication, and retain test command outcomes independently of progress.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/body/sharedContracts/3","/body/sharedContracts/4","/body/sharedContracts/5","/citations/3","/citations/4","/citations/6","/citations/10","/citations/11","/citations/15","/citations/16",