y assigned selector against the DEF and relevant code. The foundation separates execution authority, observation, freshness and retention, and specifies fenced recovery and terminal persistence before delivery. Generated ER source contradicts the intended cardinalities. Mandatory visual verification remains blocked.","findings":[{"id":"foundation-001","severity":"MED","location":"/body/erDefinition; docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/er-model.html embedded Mermaid","message":"The generated ER model contradicts the ownership contract. `Invocation ||--o| Conversation` permits only one invocation per conversation, whereas sc1 and the Invocation.conversation description explicitly allow many invocations in one conversation. It also renders `Task ||--o{ Attempt`, allowing zero attempts despite the required, one-or-more attempts definition. Correct the relationship definitions or generation inputs and regenerate the companion so its cardinalities agree with the shared contracts.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/HLD-206db3426ffd4428.json#/body/erDefinition/classes/Invocation/attributes/conversation",".insrc/artifacts/HLD-206db3426ffd4428.json#/body/erDefinition/classes/Task/attributes/attempts","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/HLD.md:56","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/er-model.html: embedded Mermaid relationship declarations"]}],"inspectedReferences":["/body/sharedContracts","/body/sharedContracts/0","/body/sharedContracts/1","/body/sharedContracts/2","/body/nonFunctional","/body/erDefinition","/body/sequenceDefinition","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/0","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/1","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/2","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/3","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/4","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/5","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/6","/citations/12","/citations/18","document:line:293","/User