rusted; specify how a replacement connection establishes authorized access to retained project/conversation tasks.","Carry the stated qualification commitments into focused cases for terminal persistence failure, exhausted observation reservations, owner lease expiry, delayed prior-epoch callbacks and conversation removal during renewal. Existing transport and session tests provide useful seams but do not establish these future coordinator behaviors."]},{"chunkId":"producers","status":"passed","summary":"Inspected all assigned producer contracts and citations against the live HLD, DEF, upstream requirements, current implementations and relevant tests. No blocking design defect was demonstrated. The adapters preserve executor authority, distinguish supported measurements from unknown values, separate review coverage and publication, and retain test command outcomes independently of progress.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/body/sharedContracts/3","/body/sharedContracts/4","/body/sharedContracts/5","/citations/3","/citations/4","/citations/6","/citations/10","/citations/11","/citations/15","/citations/16","/citations/17","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/HLD.md",".insrc/artifacts/HLD-206db3426ffd4428.json: shared contracts, story boundaries, rollout and qualification targets","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/DEF.md: k1–k3, k7 and stories s2–s4","docs/standalone/show-background-task-progress-chat-E2026110407024f1d/SPEC.md: R2, R3, R9, R12 and A2, A3, A16, A17","docs/epics/stream-incremental-progress-from-daemon-calling-E202607196d6cfaf9/HLD.md: existing progress stream compatibility","src/daemon/__tests__/workflow-progress-map.test.ts","src/daemon/__tests__/analyze-progress.test.ts","src/daemon/workflow-rpc.ts: runStart, workflowProgressToStage and makeTokenAccumulator","src/daemon/analyze-rpc.ts: runStart, makeProgressEmitter and eventToProgressData","