date observation metadata independently of completed work; retain that distinction when mapping snapshots. Tests were inspected as evidence and were not executed."]},{"chunkId":"vscode","status":"incomplete","summary":"The VS Code design aligns with the DEF on originating-chat delivery, attempt isolation, aggregate status, observer-independent retention, cancellation and project-scoped recovery. Current client contracts and relevant lifecycle tests were inspected. Visual verification of the generated UX mock remains incomplete.","findings":[{"id":"vscode-001","severity":"LOW","location":"/body/uxDefinition/body/2","message":"The unavailable-state example preserves the last measured counts but drops their measurement age, although its description says freshness is preserved. A user cannot distinguish recently verified measurements from substantially older ones. Retain an explicit as-of time or age in this state, consistent with the architecture's original-age guarantee and the upstream requirement.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/HLD-206db3426ffd4428.json#/body/uxDefinition/body/2","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/ux-mock.html: unavailable-state text and element descriptions 10–14","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/HLD.md:35","docs/standalone/show-background-task-progress-chat-E2026110407024f1d/SPEC.md: R17, progress-source failure and original measurement age"]}],"inspectedReferences":["/body/uxDefinition","/citations/19","/citations/20","/citations/21","document:line:394","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/HLD.md",".insrc/artifacts/HLD-206db3426ffd4428.json: shared contracts, s5 boundary, UX definition and companion references","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/DEF.md: k2–k8 and s5 acceptance criteria","docs/standalone/show-background-task-progress-chat-E2026110407024f1d/SPEC.md: R1, 